---
// The faint network behind every section (src/scripts/scenes/backdrop.ts). Decoration: hidden from assistive
// technology and never in the way of a click. It is fixed to the viewport at its largest height, so the address
// bar sliding away on a phone does not resize it.
---

<canvas class="page-net" data-scene="backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<style>
  .page-net {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100lvh;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
</style>
